Threaded adapters for the NateChrony

M18x1 (Unverified) - NOT recommended for long term use. The thread is quite fine, and walls relatively thin - it is recommended to use a standard variable over a shroud for this size.

5mm Blank - can be used as a template, will need to be drilled out & tapped to the required thread form.  Careful with the internal overhang & supports inside.
